  "description_html": "<fieldset><legend><b>Update 17.01.2010</b></legend>\r\nChanges:\r\n<ul><li>Removed front sights from world models with attached sights.\r\n<li>Removed dead frames (Recoil is working properly now).\r\n</fieldset>\r\n\r\nSights/Camouflage for an M4A1 RIS (I hacked the RIS on it) on ZeeJ's animations, world models now have sights too!\r\n\r\nNo arctic camouflage sorry :/\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks to streetprof for the video!\r\n<object width=\"300\"><param name=\"movie\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/v/L_nhbJnUcKk&hl=de_DE&fs=1&\"></param><param name=\"allowFullScreen\" value=\"true\"></param><param name=\"allowscriptaccess\" value=\"always\"></param><embed src=\"http://www.youtube.com/v/L_nhbJnUcKk&hl=de_DE&fs=1&\" type=\"application/x-shockwave-flash\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"300\" height=\"295\"></embed></object>\r\n\r\n<b class=red>If you got problems with any content or credits please contact me.</b>\r\n\r\n\r\n<center><a href=\"http://www.fpsbanana.com/responders/addtowl?section=users&itemid=648290\"><img src=\"http://www.abload.de/img/watchmezjqb.png\" /></a></center>",
